    "rich_text_tkcxyi": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_68YqNF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Finding the Best Travel Power Bank: From Departure to Destination",
            "heading_size": "title-md",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_4JE9zt": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Pack light, travel far, and stay connected. RORRY’s travel-pro power banks are engineered to eliminate the stress of dead batteries and tangled wires. Every charger in this collection is 100% airline-approved and designed with a 3-in-1 cable-free philosophy, fitting seamlessly into your carry-on so you can focus on the journey, not the juice.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_gBceLc": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "1. The Perfect Carry-On Companion",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_qmMyhB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Nothing ruins a travel aesthetic like carrying a cluster of wires. For those looking for the <strong>best power bank for travel</strong>, our <a href=\"/products/rorry-flow-cb4-10000mah-portable-charger-charging-with-cable-wall-plug-40w\" title=\"RORRY Flow CB4-10000mAh Portable Charger Charging with Cable & Wall Plug 40W\"><strong>RORRY Flow CB4</strong></a> and <a href=\"/products/rorry-cb06-10000mah-portable-charger-fast-charging-power-bank\" title=\"RORRY CB06 10000mAh Portable Charger(AC Wall Plug 22.5W)\"><strong>CB06</strong></a> are game-changers. Featuring built-in AC wall plugs, these models allow you to recharge directly at the airport terminal or hotel outlet without needing an extra charger block. It’s the travel pro power bank solution that keeps your bag organized and your mind at ease.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_NJAJaD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "2. 100% Airline-Approved & Worry-Free",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_HAi6PX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Security checkpoints should be the least of your worries. Every <strong>traveler battery charger</strong> at <a href=\"https://rorry.com/\" title=\"rorry\"><strong>RORRY</strong></a> is strictly compliant with TSA and international aviation standards. If you need a portable power bank for international travel that lasts through a 12-hour flight, the <a href=\"/products/rorry-charmgo-d4-10000mah-portable-charger-keychainpower-bank-45w\" title=\"RORRY CharmGo D4-10000mAh Portable Charger Keychain Power Bank 45W\"><strong>CharmGo D4 10000mAh</strong></a> provides high-speed 45W charging in a mini size. It's the best size power bank for travel.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "heading_8YayEk": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "3. Sightseeing Simplified",
            "heading_size": "title-sm",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        },
        "text_GkMCeX": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When you're out exploring a new city, the last thing you want is a heavy \"brick\" in your hand. Our <a href=\"/collections/d2-series-portable-chargers\" title=\"D2 Series Portable Chargers\"><strong>D2 Keychain Series</strong></a> and <a href=\"/collections/t1-series-keychain-power-bank\" title=\"T1 Series Keychain Power Bank\"><strong>T1 mini power banks</strong></a> are the best lightweight travel power banks for all-day sightseeing. Clip them to your camera strap or keys, and enjoy the convenience of a 3 in 1 travel charger that handles your iPhone and Apple Watch wirelessly. Join 150,000+ jetsetters who trust RORRY for their <strong>travel with power bank</strong> needs.</p>",
            "text_font": "body",
            "text_size": "subtext-md",
            "text_max_size": 32,
            "text_line_height": 1.6,
            "text_letter_spacing": 0,
            "text_capitalize": false,
            "secondary_color": false,
            "highlighted_text": "none",
            "highlighted_scribble": "circle"
          }
        }
